  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/10/IMG_8178.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El grupo Sent&iacute;o ha llenado la noche de este viernes de aire rociero el Mes&oacute;n de la Tapa durante la Fira d&#39;Onda. A lo largo de m&aacute;s de dos horas han ido desgranando sus temas en una actuaci&oacute;n organizada por el Consell de Festes fuera de programa.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiomesontapafira13/img_8156.jpg\" alt=\"img_8156\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiomesontapafira13/img_8157.jpg\" alt=\"img_8157\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiomesontapafira13/img_8158.jpg\" alt=\"img_8158\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiomesontapafira13/img_8159.jpg\" alt=\"img_8159\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiomesontapafira13/img_8161.jpg\" alt=\"img_8161\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiomesontapafira13/img_8162.jpg\" alt=\"img_8162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiomesontapafira13/img_8163.jpg\" alt=\"img_8163\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiomesontapafira13/img_8164.jpg\" alt=\"img_8164\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiomesontapafira13/img_8165.jpg\" alt=\"img_8165\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.